.TH HOMELAB-CLI-MAIL 8 "2026-08-21" "homelab-cli" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
homelab-cli\-mail \- Mail (IMAP) commands for homelab\-cli
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B homelab-cli
.RB [ --api-url
.IR url ]
.B mail
.I command
.RI [ args ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B homelab-cli mail
groups mail/IMAP-related REST calls under one command family. These talk
to the mail server as the logged-in account \- no separate mail password
is ever needed, since homelab-api authenticates to Dovecot using the same
JWT this CLI already holds.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show the current INBOX unseen and total message counts.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR homelab-cli (8),
.BR homelab-cli-drive (8),
.BR homelab-cli-admin (8)
